INSERT INTO skills_fts (id, name, owner, repo, category, search_text) VALUES ('ghirschhorn987/event-scheduling-app/Code Quality & Testing', 'Code Quality & Testing', 'ghirschhorn987', 'event-scheduling-app', 'community', 'Code Quality & Testing ghirschhorn987 event-scheduling-app community Code Quality & Testing automates testing and linting for developers, ensuring high-quality code with commands like npm run lint:fix and npm run test:unit. 代码质量和测试是软件开发中的关键环节，本节介绍如何使用npm run lint:fix和测试套件确保代码质量 コード品質とテストはソフトウェア開発の重要なステップです。本節では、npm run lint:fixとテストスイートを使用してコード品質を確保する方法を紹介します 코드 품질 및 테스트는 소프트웨어 개발의 핵심 단계입니다. 본 절에서는 npm run lint:fix 및 테스트套件을 사용하여 코드 품질을 보장하는 방법을 설명합니다 La calidad y pruebas de código son fundamentales para el desarrollo de software. Utilice herramientas de AI para automatizar tareas como npm run lint:fix y test:unit. La qualité et les tests de code sont essentiels pour le développement de logiciels. Utilisez des outils d''IA pour automatiser des tâches comme npm run lint:fix et test:unit. Code-Qualität und -Testing sind für die Software-Entwicklung von entscheidender Bedeutung. Verwenden Sie KI-Tools, um Aufgaben wie npm run lint:fix und test:unit zu automatisieren. Melhore a qualidade do seu código e teste-o com eficácia usando npm run lint:fix e npm run test:unit Улучшите качество вашего кода и протестируйте его эффективно с помощью npm run lint:fix и npm run test:unit حسن جودة كودك واختبره بفعالية باستخدام npm run lint:fix و npm run test:unit how to use Code Quality & Testing Code Quality & Testing setup guide automated testing with npm Code Quality & Testing vs Jest Code Quality & Testing install what is Code Quality & Testing Code Quality & Testing alternative npm run lint:fix tutorial Code Quality & Testing best practices 代码质量 测试自动化 npm run lint:fix 单元测试 端到端测试 AI工具 代码审查 自动化测试 Automatically resolves styling and standard linting errors using npm run lint:fix Executes core logic test suite using npm run test:unit Runs end-to-end browser tests for UI validation using npm run test:e2e Ensures 85% test coverage by automatically writing missing tests Supports automated testing using npm commands Enforces test coverage guardrails to maintain high-quality code Code Quality & Testing is a skill that automates code quality checks and testing using npm commands to ensure high test coverage and resolve styling errors');
