INSERT INTO skills_fts (id, name, owner, repo, category, search_text) VALUES ('CoralShades/acm-ai/bmad-editorial-review-prose', 'bmad-editorial-review-prose', 'CoralShades', 'acm-ai', 'community', 'bmad-editorial-review-prose CoralShades acm-ai community bmad-editorial-review-prose is an AI-driven skill for managing asbestos compliance, built on Open Notebook. It benefits developers and compliance officers by automating tasks. bmad-editorial-review-prose是一个基于Open Notebook的AI智能纤维素合规管理系统，通过编辑审查和合规管理实现智能化 bmad-editorial-review-proseは、Open Notebookに基づくAIエージェントによるアスベストコンプライアンス管理システムで、編集レビューとコンプライアンス管理を実現する bmad-editorial-review-prose는 Open Notebook 기반의 AI 도구를 사용한 석면 규정 준수 관리 시스템으로 편집 검토와 규정 준수를 통해智能化를 구현합니다 bmad-editorial-review-prose es una herramienta de gestión de cumplimiento de asbestos impulsada por IA, construida sobre Open Notebook, que permite una revisión editorial automatizada. bmad-editorial-review-prose est un outil de gestion de conformité à l''amiante alimenté par l''IA, construit sur Open Notebook, qui permet une révision éditoriale automatisée. bmad-editorial-review-prose ist ein Asbest-Konformitätsmanagement-Tool, das von künstlicher Intelligenz angetrieben wird, auf Open Notebook basiert und eine automatisierte redaktionelle Überprüfung ermöglicht. O bmad-editorial-review-prose é uma ferramenta de gerenciamento de conformidade de amiante inteligente, construída sobre a tecnologia de Open Notebook. ИИ Агент bmad-editorial-review-prose - это интеллектуальное решение для управления соблюдением требований асбеста, построенное на технологии Open Notebook. بمد-مراجعة-نص هو أداة إدارة التزام الأسبستوس الذكية، مبنية على تقنية دفتر مفتوح how to use bmad-editorial-review-prose bmad-editorial-review-prose setup guide bmad-editorial-review-prose alternative bmad-editorial-review-prose vs traditional compliance management what is bmad-editorial-review-prose bmad-editorial-review-prose install Open Notebook technology AI-powered asbestos compliance intelligent compliance management bmad-editorial-review-prose tutorial bmad-editorial-review-prose AI智能纤维素合规管理 Open Notebook 编辑审查 合规管理 AI工具 智能化 纤维素合规 Reads entire task files at {project-root}/_bmad/core/tasks/editorial-review-prose.xml Follows instructions in the task file exactly as written Utilizes Open Notebook technology for data management Supports AI-driven automation of asbestos compliance tasks Processes tasks via the editorial-review-prose.xml file Integrates with core tasks for comprehensive compliance management bmad-editorial-review-prose is an AI-powered skill for intelligent asbestos compliance management, utilizing Open Notebook technology for streamlined processes.');
