/editorial-review-prose.xml Follows instructions in the task file exactly as written Utilizes DynamoDB Relational Store for data management Supports XML file format for task definitions Enables efficient data retrieval and storage bmad-editorial-review-prose is a technical skill that enables the integration of DynamoDB Relational Store, allowing for efficient data management and retrieval.');
