INSERT INTO skills_fts (id, name, owner, repo, category, search_text) VALUES ('vuthuonghai-steve/KLTN-By_Thuong_Hai-Steve/typescript-error-explainer', 'typescript-error-explainer', 'vuthuonghai-steve', 'KLTN-By_Thuong_Hai-Steve', 'community', 'typescript-error-explainer vuthuonghai-steve KLTN-By_Thuong_Hai-Steve community typescript-error-explainer is a skill that enforces critical directives for AI agents, ensuring they read and process files correctly. It benefits developers working with AI agents by providing a structured approach to file handling. TypeScript 错误解释器是一种通过扫描和读取文件内容来帮助开发者调试和优化代码的工具 TypeScript エラーエクスプレインア AIエージェントは、ファイル内容をスキャンして読み取ることで、開発者がコードをデバッグし、最適化するのを支援するツールです TypeScript 오류 설명기는 파일 내용을 스캔하고 읽어들이는 것을 통해 개발자가 코드를 디버깅하고 최적화하는 것을 지원하는 도구입니다 typescript-error-explainer es una herramienta de ayuda para la depuración de errores en proyectos de desarrollo, que utiliza tecnologías como Read, Glob y Bash typescript-error-explainer est un outil d''aide pour la débogage d''erreurs dans les projets de développement, qui utilise des technologies comme Read, Glob et Bash typescript-error-explainer ist ein Hilfswerkzeug für die Fehlersuche in Entwicklungsprojekten, das Technologien wie Read, Glob und Bash verwendet O typescript-error-explainer é uma ferramenta que ajuda a explicar erros em código TypeScript. Utiliza comandos como Read, Glob ou Bash para scanear e ler arquivos. typescript-error-explainer - это инструмент, помогающий объяснить ошибки в коде TypeScript. Использует команды Read, Glob или Bash для сканирования и чтения файлов. typescript-error-explainer هو أداة تساعد في تفسير أخطاء في كود TypeScript. يستخدم أوامر مثل Read، Glob أو Bash لقراءة ومسح الملفات. how to use typescript-error-explainer typescript-error-explainer setup guide typescript-error-explainer alternative typescript-error-explainer vs other AI agent skills typescript-error-explainer install what is typescript-error-explainer typescript-error-explainer for AI agents critical directive enforcement in AI agents file handling in AI agents TypeScript 错误解释器 TypeScript 调试 代码优化 Read 工具 Glob 工具 Bash 工具 AI 开发工具 TypeScript 开发 Enforces critical directives for file handling in AI agents Requires use of tools like Read, Glob, or Bash for file processing Mandates direct reading of files in knowledge/, templates/, scripts/, and loop/ directories Prevents guessing or assuming file contents Ensures structured approach to file handling for AI agents typescript-error-explainer is a critical directive enforcement skill for AI agents, requiring them to read and process files using tools like Read, Glob, or Bash');
