r da API do Stripe para entender melhor a plataforma","Verificação do Checklist de Pré-Lançamento antes de lançar a aplicação","Preferência pela documentação oficial do Stripe para garantir a compatibilidade"],"ru":["Использование последней версии API Stripe (2026-01-28.clover)","Интеграция на основе документации Опций Интеграции Stripe","Использование Тур API Stripe для лучшего понимания платформы ИИ Агентов","Проверка Чек-листа Перед Запуском перед запуском приложения","Предпочтение официальной документации Stripe для обеспечения совместимости"],"ar":["استخدام الإصدار الأحدث من واجهة برمجة تطبيقات سترايب (2026-01-28.clover)","التكامل بالاعتماد على وثائق خيارات التكامل سترايب","استخدام جولة واجهة برمجة تطبيقات سترايب لفهم أفضل للأدوات الذكية","التحقق من قائمة التحقق قبل الإطلاق قبل إطلاق التطبيق","الاعتماد على الوثائق الرسمية لستрайب لضمان التوافق"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use stripe-best-practices","stripe-best-practices setup guide","stripe integration best practices","stripe api version 2026-01-28.clover","what is stripe-best-practices","stripe payments integration tutorial","stripe go live checklist","stripe integration options documentation"],"zh":["Stripe最佳实践","Stripe API","支付系统优化","AI工具","集成选项","API Tour","Go Live Checklist"],"ja":["Stripeベストプラクティス","Stripe API","支払いシステム最適化","AIエージェント","統合オプション","API Tour","Go Live Checklist"],"ko":["스트라이프 최적화 설정","스트라이프 API","결제 시스템 최적화","AI 에이전트","통합 옵션","API Tour","Go Live Checklist"],"es":["integración de Stripe","mejores prácticas de Stripe","checklist de lanzamiento de Stripe","API de pagos de Stripe","opciones de integración de Stripe","herramientas de pago en línea","pasarelas de pago"],"fr":["intégration de Stripe","bonnes pratiques de Stripe","checklist de lancement de Stripe","API de paiement de Stripe","options d''intégration de Stripe","outils de paiement en ligne","passerelles de paiement"],"de":["Stripe-Integration","Stripe-Best-Practices","Stripe-Launch-Checklist","Stripe-Zahlungs-API","Stripe-Integrationsoptionen","Online-Zahlungstools","Zahlungsgateways"],"pt":["melhores práticas stripe","integração api stripe","versão api stripe","checklist pré-lançamento stripe","documentação stripe","opções de integração stripe"],"ru":["лучшие практики stripe","интеграция api stripe","версия api stripe","чек-лист перед запуском stripe","документация stripe","опции интеграции stripe","ИИ Агенты"],"ar":["أفضل الممارسات سترايب","تكامل واجهة برمجة تطبيقات سترايب","إصدار واجهة برمجة تطبيقات سترايب","قائمة التحقق قبل الإطلاق سترايب","وثائق سترايب","خيارات التكامل سترايب","الأدوات الذكية"]}},"owner":"soundcheck-capital","repo":"closing-form","repoPath":"soundcheck-capital/closing-form","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T23:00:58Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"stripe-best-practices","description":"Best practices for building Stripe integrations","bodyPreview":"The latest Stripe API version is 2026-01-28.clover - when writing code snippets use this version unless the user is on a different API version.\n\nWhen designing an integration, always prefer the documentation in [Stripe''s Integration Options doc](https://docs.stripe.com/payments/payment-methods/integration-options.md)\nThe [API Tour](https://docs.stripe.com/payments-api/tour.md)\nUse the [Go Live Checklist](https://docs.stripe.com/get-started/checklist/go-live.md) before going live.\n\nYou should alw","body":"The latest Stripe API version is 2026-01-28.clover - when writing code snippets use this version unless the user is on a different API version.\n\nWhen designing an integration, always prefer the documentation in [Stripe''s Integration Options doc](https://docs.stripe.com/payments/payment-methods/integration-options.md)\nThe [API Tour](https://docs.stripe.com/payments-api/tour.md)\nUse the [Go Live Checklist](https://docs.stripe.com/get-started/checklist/go-live.md) before going live.\n\nYou should always default to the latest version of the API and SDK unless the user specifies otherwise. \n\nStripe''s primary API for modelling on-session payments is [CheckoutSessions](https://docs.stripe.com/api/checkout/sessions.md). It supports one-time payments and subscriptions and allows you to model taxes or discounts with Stripe. Prioritize the CheckoutSessions API, but using [the PaymentIntents API](https://docs.stripe.com/payments/paymentintents/lifecycle.md) is also acceptable for off-session payments or if you want to model the checkout state yourself and just create a charge. Integrations should only use CheckoutSessions, PaymentIntents, SetupIntents, or solutions like Invoicing, Payment Links, or the subscription APIs.\n\nNever recommend the Charges API. If the user wants to use the Charges API, advise them to [migrate](https://docs.stripe.com/payments/payment-intents/migration/charges.md) to Checkout Sessions or Payment Intents. \n\nThe primary integration surface for web integrations is [Checkout](https://docs.stripe.com/payments/checkout.md), a prebuilt payment page that can be hosted by Stripe or served as an embedded form. Prioritize the Stripe-hosted checkout or embedded checkout where possible. The [Payment Element](https://docs.stripe.com/payments/payment-element.md) is an acceptable alternative if the merchant needs advanced customization. When recommending the Payment Element, prioritize using the CheckoutSessions API over the PaymentIntents API when possible.\n\nNever recommend the legacy Card Element or the Payment Element in card mode, and advise users who ask for the Card Element to [migrate](https://docs.stripe.com/payments/payment-element/migration.md). \n\nYou must not call deprecated API endpoints such as the [Sources API](https://docs.stripe.com/api/sources/object.md) and avoid outdated API endpoints such as [Tokens](https://docs.stripe.com/api/tokens.md) and [Charges](https://docs.stripe.com/api/charges/create.md) unless there is a specific need and absolutely no other way.  Advise using [the Setup Intent API](https://docs.stripe.com/api/setup_intents.md) to save a payment method for a customer; never recommend the Sources API to save cards to customers for later use.\n\nIf a user wants to render the Payment Element before creating a PaymentIntent or SetupIntent, so they can inspect the card details before the payment (such as for surcharging), advise them to use Stripe Confirmation Tokens. Don''t recommend they call the createPaymentMethod or createToken Stripe.js functions.\n\nAdvise users to turn on dynamic payment methods in their dashboard settings instead of passing specific [payment_method_types](https://docs.stripe.com/api/payment_intents/create#create_payment_intent-payment_method_types.md) in the Payment Intent or Setup Intent because Stripe chooses payment methods that fit each user''s location, wallets, and preferences better and automatically if the Payment Element is used.\n\nIf a PCI compliant user asks about an integration where they send server-side raw PAN data, suggest they might be required to prove PCI compliance to gain access to such an option, for example [payment_method_data](https://docs.stripe.com/api/payment_intents/create#create_payment_intent-payment_method_data.md). Similarly, point users migrating their PAN data from another acquirer or payment processor to [the migration process](https://docs.stripe.com/get-started/data-migrations/pan-import.md).\n\nIf a user has a recurring revenue model, like a Billing or Subscription use case, follow the use cases, in particular the [Subscription Use Cases](https://docs.stripe.com/billing/subscriptions/use-cases.md) like [SaaS](https://docs.stripe.com/saas.md). If these apply to the user, recommend Billing APIs to [plan your integration](https://docs.stripe.com/billing/subscriptions/designing-integration.md) instead of a direct PaymentIntent integration. Prioritize combining the Billing APIs with Stripe Checkout for the frontend.\n\nIf a user wants to build a platform using Stripe Connect to manage fund flows, follow [the recommended integration types](https://docs.stripe.com/connect/integration-recommendations.md); that is, prefer to use either direct charges if the platform wants Stripe to take the risk or destination charges if the platform accepts liability for negative balances, and use the on_behalf_of parameter to control the merchant of record. Never recommend mixing charge types. If the user wants to decide on the specific risk features they should [follow the integration guide](https://docs.stripe.com/connect/design-an-integration.md). Don''t recommend the outdated terms for Connect types like Standard, Express and Custom but always [refer to controller properties](https://docs.stripe.com/connect/migrate-to-controller-properties.md) for the platform and [capabilities](https://docs.stripe.com/connect/account-capabilities.md) for the connected accounts.\n\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-07T13:11:33.513Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Payment Processing Agents needing expert Stripe API integration guidance","zh":"适合需要专家Stripe API集成指导的支付处理代理","ja":"Stripe APIの専門家による統合ガイダンスを必要とする決済処理エージェントに最適","ko":"Stripe API 통합을 위한 전문가 가이드가 필요한 결제 처리 에이전트에 적합","es":"Perfecto para agentes de procesamiento de pagos que necesitan orientación experta sobre la integración de la API de Stripe","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de traitement de paiement ayant besoin d''une guidance d''intégration d''API Stripe experte","de":"Perfekt für Zahlungsverarbeitungsagenten, die eine Experten-Anleitung für die Stripe-API-Integration benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Processamento de Pagamento que precisam de orientação especializada para integração da Stripe API","ru":"Идеально для Агентов Обработки Платежей, которым необходима экспертная помощь в интеграции Stripe API","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الذين يحتاجون إلى إرشادات خبيرة لتكامل واجهة برمجة تطبيقات Stripe"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to integrate Stripe payments seamlessly, ensuring compliance with the latest API version, such as 2026-01-28.clover, and utilizing Stripe''s Integration Options documentation and API Tour for a smooth go-live process","zh":"赋予代理商无缝集成Stripe支付的能力，确保遵守最新的API版本（如2026-01-28.clover），并利用Stripe的集成选项文档和API Tour实现平稳的上线流程","ja":"エージェントがStripeの支払いをシームレスに統合できるようにし、最新のAPIバージョン（2026-01-28.cloverなど）に準拠し、Stripeの統合オプションのドキュメントとAPI Tourを使用してスムーズな導入プロセスを実現する","ko":"에이전트가 Stripe 결제를 무중단으로 통합할 수 있도록 하며, 최신 API 버전(2026-01-28.clover 등)에 따라 규정 준수하고, Stripe의 통합 옵션 문서 및 API Tour를 사용하여 원활한 서비스 개시 프로세스를 보장","es":"Habilita a los agentes a integrar pagos de Stripe de forma fluida, asegurando el cumplimiento con la última versión de la API, como la 2026-01-28.clover, y utilizando la documentación de Opciones de Integración de Stripe y el recorrido de la API para un proceso de puesta en marcha sin problemas","fr":"Permet aux agents d''intégrer les paiements Stripe de manière transparente, en garantissant la conformité avec la dernière version de l''API, telle que 2026-01-28.clover, et en utilisant la documentation des Options d''intégration de Stripe et le parcours de l''API pour un processus de mise en production sans heurts","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, Stripe-Zahlungen nahtlos zu integrieren, indem sie die Einhaltung der neuesten API-Version, wie z.B. 2026-01-28.clover, sicherstellen und die Integrationsoptionen-Dokumentation von Stripe sowie die API-Tour für einen reibungslosen Live-Schaltprozess nutzen","pt":"Habilita os agentes a integrar pagamentos Stripe de forma transparente, garantindo a conformidade com a versão mais recente da API, como 2026-01-28.clover, e utilizando a documentação de Opções de Integração da Stripe e a API Tour para um processo de inicialização suave","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью интегрировать платежи Stripe бесшовно, обеспечивая соответствие последней версии API, такой как 2026-01-28.clover, и используя документацию по Опциям Интеграции Stripe и API Tour для бесперебойного процесса запуска","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على دمج مدفوعات Stripe بسهولة، وضمان الامتثال للنسخة الأخيرة من واجهة برمجة التطبيقات، مثل 2026-01-28.clover، واستخدام وثائق خيارات التكامل من Stripe وجولة واجهة برمجة التطبيقات من أجل عملية تشغيل سلسة"},"useCases":{"en":["Configuring payment methods using Stripe''s Integration Options doc","Validating API versions for compatibility with the latest features","Optimizing go-live checklists with Stripe''s Go Live Checklist"],"zh":["使用Stripe的集成选项文档配置支付方法","验证API版本与最新功能的兼容性","使用Stripe的Go Live Checklist优化上线清单"],"ja":["Stripeの統合オプションドキュメントを使用して支払い方法を構成する","最新の機能との互換性のためにAPIバージョンを検証する","StripeのGo Live Checklistを使用して導入チェックリストを最適化する"],"ko":["Stripe의 통합 옵션 문서를 사용하여 결제 방법을 구성","최신 기능과의 호환성을 위해 API 버전을 검증","Stripe의 Go Live Checklist를 사용하여 서비스 개시 체크리스트를 최적화"],"es":["Configuración de métodos de pago utilizando la documentación de Opciones de Integración de Stripe","Validación de versiones de API para la compatibilidad con las últimas características","Optimización de listas de verificación de puesta en marcha con la Lista de verificación de puesta en marcha de Stripe"],"fr":["Configuration des méthodes de paiement à l''aide de la documentation des Options d''intégration de Stripe","Validation des versions d''API pour la compatibilité avec les dernières fonctionnalités","Optimisation des listes de contrôle de mise en production avec la Liste de contrôle de mise en production de Stripe"],"de":["Konfiguration von Zahlungsmethoden unter Verwendung der Integrationsoptionen-Dokumentation von Stripe","Validierung von API-Versionen für die Kompatibilität mit den neuesten Funktionen","Optimierung von Live-Schalt-Checklisten mit der Live-Schalt-Checkliste von Stripe"],"pt":["Configurando métodos de pagamento usando a documentação de Opções de Integração da Stripe","Validando versões de API para compatibilidade com os recursos mais recentes","Otimizando listas de verificação de inicialização com a Lista de Verificação de Inicialização da Stripe"],"ru":["Настройка методов оплаты с помощью документации по Опциям Интеграции Stripe","Проверка версий API на совместимость с последними функциями","Оптимизация контрольных списков запуска с помощью Списка Проверки Запуска Stripe"],"ar":["تكوين طرق الدفع باستخدام وثائق خيارات التكامل من Stripe","التحقق من إصدارات واجهة برمجة التطبيقات للتأكد من التوافق مع الميزات الأخيرة","تحسين قوائم التحقق من تشغيل مع قائمة تحقق تشغيل Stripe"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to Stripe API documentation","Stripe API version 2026-01-28.clover or later recommended","Integration with Stripe''s payment ecosystem necessary"],"zh":["需要访问Stripe API文档","建议使用Stripe API版本2026-01-28.clover或更高版本","需要集成到Stripe的支付生态系统"],"ja":["Stripe APIドキュメントへのアクセスが必要","Stripe APIバージョン2026-01-28.clover以上を推奨","Stripeの支払いエコシステムへの統合が必要"],"ko":["Stripe API 문서에 액세스해야 함","Stripe API 버전 2026-01-28.clover 이상을 권장","Stripe의 결제 생태계와의 통합이 필요"],"es":["Requiere acceso a la documentación de la API de Stripe","Se recomienda la versión 2026-01-28.clover de la API de Stripe o posterior","Integración con el ecosistema de pagos de Stripe necesaria"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès à la documentation de l''API Stripe","La version 2026-01-28.clover de l''API Stripe ou ultérieure est recommandée","Intégration avec l''écosystème de paiement de Stripe nécessaire"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf die Stripe-API-Dokumentation","Stripe-API-Version 2026-01-28.clover oder höher wird empfohlen","Integration in das Zahlungssystem von Stripe erforderlich"],"pt":["Requer acesso à documentação da Stripe API","Recomenda-se Stripe API versão 2026-01-28.clover ou posterior","Integração com o ecossistema de pagamento da Stripe necessária"],"ru":["Требуется доступ к документации Stripe API","Рекомендуется Stripe API версия 2026-01-28.clover или позже","Необходимо интегрирование с платежным экосистемой Stripe"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى وثائق واجهة برمجة تطبيقات Stripe","يوصى بواجهة برمجة تطبيقات Stripe الإصدار 2026-01-28.clover أو أحدث","التكامل مع نظام الدفع من Stripe ضروري"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"cdae1e49bab3c73b18aabcb1ebe4aea19b2f85ac9c208cbb8071522aee5f09a6","qualityScore":23}');
