 règles et d''agents de sécurité pour React Native qui aident les développeurs à créer des applications sécurisées avec l''aide de l''intelligence artificielle","de":"Ein Satz von Sicherheitsregeln und -agenten für React Native, der Entwicklern hilft, sichere Anwendungen mit Unterstützung von Künstlicher Intelligenz zu erstellen","pt":"O que é security-reactnative? É um conjunto de diretrizes para segurança em React Native.","ru":"Что такое security-reactnative? Это набор руководств для безопасности в React Native.","ar":"ما هي security-reactnative؟ هي مجموعة من الإرشادات للأمان في React Native."},"features":{"en":["Provides guidelines and best practices for secure React Native development","Includes standardized rules for multiple technology stacks","Offers detailed documentation in ../../rules/11-security-reactnative.md","Supports installation of standardized agents and commands for projects","Enables AI-assisted development for secure React Native applications","Follows expert knowledge for secure coding practices"],"zh":["标准化的安全规则","React Native 应用安全最佳实践","AI 辅助开发框架","多技术栈支持"],"ja":["標準化されたセキュリティルール","React Native アプリのセキュリティベストプラクティス","AI アシスト開発フレームワーク","複数のテクノロジースタックのサポート"],"ko":["표준화된 보안 규칙","React Native 애플리케이션 보안 설정 가이드","AI 지원 개발 프레임워크","다중 기술 스택 지원"],"es":["Reglas estandarizadas para la seguridad en React Native","Agentes de seguridad para el desarrollo asistido por IA","Mejores prácticas para la seguridad en aplicaciones móviles","Integración con tecnologías de inteligencia artificial","Seguridad para aplicaciones React Native en múltiples plataformas"],"fr":["Règles standardisées pour la sécurité dans React Native","Agents de sécurité pour le développement assisté par l''IA","Bonnes pratiques pour la sécurité dans les applications mobiles","Intégration avec les technologies d''intelligence artificielle","Sécurité pour les applications React Native sur plusieurs plateformes"],"de":["Standardisierte Sicherheitsregeln für React Native","Sicherheitsagenten für die KI-gestützte Entwicklung","Best Practices für die Sicherheit in mobilen Anwendungen","Integration mit KI-Technologien","Sicherheit für React-Native-Anwendungen auf mehreren Plattformen"],"pt":["Implementação de regras de segurança padrão","Integração com tecnologias de segurança de múltiplos stacks","Melhores práticas para desenvolvimento de aplicativos seguros em React Native","Padronização de comandos e agentes para projetos","Documentação detalhada para regras de segurança"],"ru":["Реализация стандартных правил безопасности","Интеграция с технологиями безопасности нескольких стеков","Лучшие практики для разработки безопасных приложений на React Native","Стандартизация команд и агентов для проектов","Детальная документация для правил безопасности"],"ar":["تنفيذ قواعد أمان موحدة","التكامل مع تقنيات أمان متعددة","أفضل الممارسات لتطوير تطبيقات آمنة في React Native","توحيد أوامر ووكلاء للمشاريع","توثيق مفصل للقواعد الأمنية"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use security-reactnative","security-reactnative setup guide","react native security best practices","security-reactnative alternative","security-reactnative vs owasp","install security-reactnative","what is security-reactnative","security-reactnative documentation","react native security guidelines","security-reactnative tutorial"],"zh":["React Native 安全性","AI 辅助开发","标准化规则","安全最佳实践","React Native 开发","AI 工具"],"ja":["React Native セキュリティ","AI エージェント","標準化ルール","セキュリティベストプラクティス","React Native 開発","AI ツール"],"ko":["React Native 보안","AI 에이전트","표준화된 규칙","보안 설정 가이드","React Native 개발","AI 도구"],"es":["seguridad react native","agentes de inteligencia artificial","desarrollo asistido por ia","reglas de seguridad para react native","mejores prácticas para la seguridad en aplicaciones móviles","integración con inteligencia artificial","seguridad para aplicaciones react native"],"fr":["sécurité react native","outils d''intelligence artificielle","développement assisté par l''ia","règles de sécurité pour react native","bonnes prat