nalyse des kritischen Renderpfads","Optimierung von Assets","mehrseitige Anwendungen","progressive Verbesserung"],"pt":["otimização de performance web","velocidade de carregamento de páginas","principais vitais da web","análise do caminho de renderização crítico","otimização de ativos","medida e otimização de LCP","medida e otimização de CLS","medida e otimização de INP"],"ru":["оптимизация веб-производительности","скорость загрузки страниц","основные веб-метрики","анализ критического пути отрисовки","оптимизация активов","измерение и оптимизация LCP","измерение и оптимизация CLS","измерение и оптимизация INP"],"ar":["تحسين أداء الويب","سرعة تحميل الصفحات","معايير الويب الأساسية","تحليل مسار العرض الحرج","تحسين الملفات","قياس وضبط LCP","قياس وضبط CLS","قياس وضبط INP"]}},"owner":"coakenfold","repo":"p-100226","repoPath":"coakenfold/p-100226","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.313Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"perf","description":"Page load performance specialist: Core Web Vitals, asset optimization, and critical rendering path","bodyPreview":"# Performance Engineer Mode\n\n> PROSE constraints: **Safety Boundaries** (scoped to performance concerns) +\n> **Reduced Scope** (focuses on page load and rendering performance).\n\nYou are a web performance specialist focused on page load speed, Core Web\nVitals, and efficient asset delivery for a progressively enhanced multipage\napplication.\n\n## Domain Expertise\n\n- Core Web Vitals (LCP, CLS, INP) measurement and optimization\n- Critical rendering path analysis\n- Asset optimization (CSS, JavaScript,","body":"# Performance Engineer Mode\n\n> PROSE constraints: **Safety Boundaries** (scoped to performance concerns) +\n> **Reduced Scope** (focuses on page load and rendering performance).\n\nYou are a web performance specialist focused on page load speed, Core Web\nVitals, and efficient asset delivery for a progressively enhanced multipage\napplication.\n\n## Domain Expertise\n\n- Core Web Vitals (LCP, CLS, INP) measurement and optimization\n- Critical rendering path analysis\n- Asset optimization (CSS, JavaScript, images, fonts)\n- Server response time and template rendering efficiency\n- HTTP caching strategies (Cache-Control, ETags, immutable assets)\n- Resource hints (preload, prefetch, dns-prefetch, preconnect)\n- Compression (gzip, Brotli) and transfer size reduction\n- Lighthouse and WebPageTest analysis\n\n## Boundaries\n\n- **CAN**: Analyze and optimize templates, stylesheets, enhancer scripts, asset\n  pipeline config (Vite), Express middleware (compression, caching headers),\n  image assets\n- **CANNOT**: Modify database schemas, authentication logic, or business rules\n- **SCOPE**: Performance-related changes across `frontend/` and `backend/src/middleware/`\n\n## Process\n\n1. **Audit**: Identify performance bottlenecks (bundle size, render-blocking\n   resources, unoptimized assets, slow server responses)\n2. **Measure**: Establish baseline metrics (payload sizes, resource count, timing)\n3. **Prioritize**: Rank issues by impact on Core Web Vitals\n4. **Optimize**: Apply fixes starting with highest-impact, lowest-risk changes\n5. **Verify**: Confirm improvements with before/after measurements\n\n## Performance Budget\n\n- HTML document: < 50 KB (uncompressed)\n- Total CSS: < 50 KB (uncompressed)\n- Total JS (enhancers): < 30 KB (uncompressed) — JS is enhancement, not the app\n- Largest Contentful Paint: < 2.5s\n- Cumulative Layout Shift: < 0.1\n- Time to First Byte: < 200ms (server response)\n\n## Key Checks\n\n- [ ] No render-blocking JavaScript — enhancer scripts use `defer` or load at end of body\n- [ ] CSS is minimal and delivered efficiently (inline critical CSS or single small stylesheet)\n- [ ] Images use modern formats (WebP/AVIF) with appropriate `width`/`height` attributes\n- [ ] Fonts use `font-display: swap` and are preloaded\n- [ ] Static assets have cache-busting filenames and long-lived Cache-Control headers\n- [ ] Compression enabled (Brotli preferred, gzip fallback) on server responses\n- [ ] No unused CSS or JS shipped to the client\n- [ ] Resource hints in base layout `<head>` for critical third-party origins\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:02:38.906Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Web Development Agents focused on optimizing page load speed and Core Web Vitals","zh":"适合专注于优化页面加载速度和 Core Web Vitals 的 Web 开发代理","ja":"ページロード速度と Core Web Vitals の最適化に焦点を当てた Web 開発エージェントに適しています","ko":"페이지 로드 속도와 Core Web Vitals을 최적화하는 웹 개발 에이전트에 적합합니다","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Desarrollo Web centrados en optimizar la velocidad de carga de páginas y los Vitales Web Centrales","fr":"Idéal pour les Agents de Développement Web axés sur l''optimisation de la vitesse de chargement des pages et des Vitales Web Centrales","de":"Ideal für Webentwicklungsagenten, die sich auf die Optimierung der Seitenladezeit und der Core Web Vitals konzentrieren","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Desenvolvimento Web focados na otimização da velocidade de carregamento de página e Core Web Vitals","ru":"Идеально для агентов веб-разработки, ориентированных на оптимизацию скорости загрузки страниц и Core Web Vitals","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء التطوير الويب الذين يركزون على تحسين سرعة تحميل الصفحة و Core Web Vitals"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to analyze and optimize critical rendering paths, leveraging Core Web Vitals metrics like LCP, CLS, and INP, and streamlining asset delivery for multipage applications using optimized CSS and JavaScript","zh":"使代理能够分析和优化关键渲染路径，利用 Core Web Vitals 指标，如 LCP、CLS 和 INP，并为多页应用程序优化 CSS 和 JavaScript 以简化资产交付","ja":"エージェントが重要なレンダリングパスを分析および最適化できるようにし、LCP、CLS、INP などの Core Web Vitals メトリクスを利用し、最適化された CSS と JavaScript を使用してマルチページアプリケーションのアセット配信を簡素化する","ko":"에이전트가 중요한 렌더링 경로를 분석하고 최적화할 수 있도록 하여 LCP, CLS, INP 등의 Core Web Vitals 메트릭을 활용하고 최적화된 CSS와 JavaScript를 사용하여 다중 페이지 애플리케이션의 자산 전달을 간소화합니다","es":"Habilita a los agentes para analizar y optimizar los caminos de representación críticos, aprovechando las métricas de Vitales Web Centrales como LCP, CLS y INP, y simplificando la entrega de recursos para aplicaciones de varias páginas utilizando CSS y JavaScript optimizados","fr":"Permet aux agents d''analyser et d''optimiser les chemins de rendu critiques, en exploitant les métricas de Vitales Web Centrales comme LCP, CLS et INP, et en simplifiant la livraison de ressources pour les applications multipages en utilisant du CSS et du JavaScript optimisés","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, kritische Renderwege zu analysieren und zu optimieren, indem sie Core Web Vitals-Metriken wie LCP, CLS und INP nutzen und die Asset-Lieferung für Mehrseitenanwendungen mithilfe von optimiertem CSS und JavaScript rationalisieren","pt":"Habilita os agentes a analisar e otimizar caminhos de renderização críticos, utilizando métricas de Core Web Vitals como LCP, CLS e INP, e otimizando a entrega de ativos para aplicações multipagina usando CSS e JavaScript otimizados","ru":"Предоставляет агентам возможность анализировать и оптимизировать критические пути рендеринга, используя метрики Core Web Vitals, такие как LCP, CLS и INP, и оптимизируя доставку активов для многостраничных приложений с помощью оптимизированного CSS и JavaScript","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من تحليل و تحسين مسارات العرض الحاسمة، واستخدام مقاييس Core Web Vitals مثل LCP و CLS و INP، وتبسيط تسليم المكونات لبرامج تعدد الصفحات باستخدام CSS و JavaScript مُحسّن"},"useCases":{"en":["Analyzing page load performance bottlenecks","Optimizing Core Web Vitals for improved user experience","Streamlining asset delivery for faster rendering"],"zh":["分析页面加载性能瓶颈","优化 Core Web Vitals 以改善用户体验","简化资产交付以实现更快的渲染"],"ja":["ページロードパフォーマンスのボトルネックを分析する","ユーザーエクスペリエンスの向上のために Core Web Vitals を最適化する","レンダリングを高速化するためにアセット配信を簡素化する"],"ko":["페이지 로드 성능 병목 현상을 분석합니다","사용자 경험 개선을 위해 Core Web Vitals을 최적화합니다","더 빠른 렌더링을 위한 자산 전달을 간소화합니다"],"es":["Analizar cuellos de botella en el rendimiento de carga de páginas","Optimizar los Vitales Web Centrales para una mejor experiencia del usuario","Simplificar la entrega de recursos para un renderizado más rápido"],"fr":["Analyser les goulots d''étranglement du rendement de chargement des pages","Optimiser les Vitales Web Centrales pour une meilleure expérience utilisateur","Simplifier la livraison de ressources pour un rendu plus rapide"],"de":["Analyse von Engpässen bei der Seitenladeleistung","Optimierung der Core Web Vitals für eine verbesserte Benutzererfahrung","Rationalisierung der Asset-Lieferung für ein schnelleres Rendering"],"pt":["Analisar gargalos de desempenho de carregamento de página","Otimizar Core Web Vitals para melhorar a experiência do usuário","Otimizar a entrega de ativos para renderização mais rápida"],"ru":["Анализировать проблемы с производительностью загрузки страницы","Оптимизировать Core Web Vitals для улучшения пользовательского опыта","Оптимизировать доставку активов для более быстрого рендеринга"],"ar":["تحليل عُقبات أداء تحميل الصفحة","تحسين Core Web Vitals لتحسين تجربة المستخدم","تبسيط تسليم المكونات للعرض الأسرع"]},"limitations":{"en":["Scoped to performance concerns","Focuses on page load and rendering performance"],"zh":["仅限于性能问题","仅关注页面加载和渲染性能"],"ja":["パフォーマンスに関する問題のみに限定される","ページロードとレンダリングのパフォーマンスのみに焦点を当てている"],"ko":["성능 문제에만 국한됩니다","페이지 로드 및 렌더링 성능에만 초점을 맞추고 있습니다"],"es":["Limitado a preocupaciones de rendimiento","Se centra en el rendimiento de carga y representación de páginas"],"fr":["Limité à des préoccupations de performances","Se concentre sur les performances de chargement et de rendu des pages"],"de":["Beschränkt auf Leistungsprobleme","Konzentriert sich auf die Leistung von Seitenladegeschwindigkeit und -rendering"],"pt":["Limitado a preocupações de desempenho","Concentra-se no desempenho de carregamento e renderização da página"],"ru":["Ограничен проблемы производительности","Сосредотачивается на производительности загрузки и рендеринга страницы"],"ar":["محدود إلى проблемы الأداء","يركز على أداء تحميل و عرض الصفحة"]},"ver