INSERT INTO skills_fts (id, name, owner, repo, category, search_text) VALUES ('coakenfold/p-100226/perf', 'perf', 'coakenfold', 'p-100226', 'community', 'perf coakenfold p-100226 community The perf skill helps web performance specialists optimize page load speed, Core Web Vitals, and asset delivery for multipage applications. It benefits developers seeking to improve user experience. perf 是一个专注于页面加载速度、Core Web Vitals 和资产交付的性能优化工具 perf はページロード速度、Core Web Vitals、資産配信に焦点を当てたパフォーマンス最適化ツールです perf 는 페이지 로드 속도, Core Web Vitals, 자산 전달에 중점을 둔 성능 최적화 도구입니다 El agente de IA perf es un especialista en rendimiento web que se centra en la velocidad de carga de página y los vitales web centrales L''agent de IA perf est un spécialiste des performances web qui se concentre sur la vitesse de chargement de page et les vitals web centraux Der perf-KI-Agent ist ein Web-Performance-Spezialist, der sich auf die Seitenladezeit und die Kernwebvitals konzentriert O Perf é uma ferramenta de otimização de performance web que melhora a velocidade de carregamento de páginas e os principais vitais da web ИИ Агент Perf - это инструмент для оптимизации веб-производительности, который улучшает скорость загрузки страниц и основные веб-метрики أداة Perf هي أداة لتحسين أداء الويب التي تحسن سرعة تحميل الصفحات والمعايير الأساسية للويب how to use perf for Core Web Vitals optimization perf vs Lighthouse for performance auditing what is perf in web development perf setup guide for AI agents perf alternative for page speed optimization how to install perf for web performance optimization perf tutorial for beginners optimizing page load speed with perf perf best practices for asset delivery perf 性能优化 Web 性能优化工具 页面加载速度优化 Core Web Vitals 优化 资产交付优化 进步式增强的多页应用 性能工程师 AIエージェント Measures and optimizes Core Web Vitals (LCP, CLS, INP) for improved user experience Analyzes critical rendering paths for efficient asset delivery Optimizes CSS and JavaScript assets for faster page loads Focuses on page load speed and rendering performance for multipage applications Applies Safety Boundaries and Reduced Scope for targeted performance concerns Delivers progressively enhanced user experiences through optimized asset delivery perf is a performance engineering mode focused on optimizing page load and rendering performance, with expertise in Core Web Vitals and asset optimization.');
